  "name": "Cabbage and Pepper Coleslaw",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, tangy vegetable slaw",
  "description": "Shredded cabbage, peppers, onion, and carrot are tossed with a sweet cider-vinegar dressing for a fresh side dish.",
